{"type":"Film","id":"HR2016_004","slug":"hr2016-004-ministarstvo-ljubavi","title":{"native":"Ministarstvo ljubavi","english":"Ministry of Love"},"release":{"type":"Theatrical release","date":"2016-11-03","year":2016},"filmType":"Fiction film","directors":[{"id":"Pavo Marinković","slug":"pavo-marinkovic","name":"Pavo Marinković","birthYear":1967,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Male identifying","nationality":"Croatia","awards":[]}],"genre":["Comedy","Drama","Romance"],"media":{"posterUrl":"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt5799780/mediaviewer/rm2343048960/?ref_=tt_ov_i","trailerUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5XbSxsq_7GM&ab_channel=LandHR"},"synopsis":{"native":"Država je odlučila stati na kraj udovicama hrvatskih branitelja koje žive u izvanbračnim zajednicama, a primaju mirovine pokojnih muževa. Za hvatanje udovica u prijestupu na teren šalju potpuno pogrešnog čovjeka, nezaposlenog biologa Krešu, posrnula samopouzdanja i u bračnoj krizi. Stvari se dodatno zakompliciraju kada se zaljubi u jednu od udovica.","english":"Film portrait of the Turkish painter Güler Yücel (1935-2020), wife of the political poet Can Yücel (1926-1999). Her paintings show weddings and funerals, she painted her husband and herself. In a way, her paintings tell of the cycle of life, for example, when she captures the annual almond blossom and the traditional olive harvest - all things from her own everyday life: \"I can't paint anything I haven't seen,\" says Yücel."},"production":[{"country":"Croatia","share":"Majority coproducer"},{"country":"Czechia","share":"Minority coproducer"}],"characters":[],"roles":[{"person":{"id":"Alma Prica","slug":"alma-prica","name":"Alma Prica","birthYear":1962,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Croatia","awards":[]},"role":"Supporting actor"},{"person":{"id":"Bruna Bebić-Tudor","slug":"bruna-bebic-tudor","name":"Bruna Bebić-Tudor","birthYear":1964,"deathYear":0,"gender":"Female identifying","nationality":"Croatia","awards":[]},"role":"Minor ac